**/.DS_Store
.idea
.phpunit.result.cache
.phpunit.cache
.vscode
build
coverage
# ⚠️ `docs/*`, NOT `docs` — git cannot re-include a file whose parent DIRECTORY is
# excluded, so the skeleton's blanket `docs` made the negations below dead and
# silently swallowed the design spec. Excluding the directory's CONTENTS instead
# lets `!docs/superpowers/` actually work.
docs/*
!docs/superpowers/
node_modules
phpunit.xml
phpstan.neon
testbench.yaml
vendor
